# SDK Container Cache Version
#
# Increment this value to force a full SDK scratch rebuild on the next
# pipeline run. The content of this file is included in the SDK content
# hash used for ACR-based caching (see acl-pipelines RFC:
# docs/rfcs/sdk-container-caching.md).
#
# When to increment:
#   - A change to a shared infrastructure file outside the hash scope
#     affects the SDK container output
#   - Suspected stale upstream base image (ghcr.io/flatcar/flatcar-sdk-all)
#   - Transient build environment issue produced a bad cached image
#
# Shared files NOT in the content hash (require salt bump if changed):
#   - common.sh          — core library sourced by update_chroot, setup_board
#   - settings.env       — binary package server URLs, sourced by common.sh
#   - lib/shflags/shflags — CLI flag parsing library, sourced by common.sh
#   - update_chroot      — top-level SDK update entry point
#   - setup_board        — board setup entry point (calls update_chroot)
#   - flatcar_workon     — package workon management
